WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Jamie starts DI into the recorded Ryu DI.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.050
The counter DI crumples Ryu at the wall.

3
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.450
Crouching heavy punch connects during the crumple.

4
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.450
OD Swagger Step launches Ryu.

5
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.150
Standing heavy punch catches the OD-Palm fall during raw Rush.

6
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.550
The final cancel-Rush crouching heavy connects as Jamie reaches burnout.

7
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.600
Heavy Bakkai continues before the Super cancel.

8
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.100
Jamie spends the Level 3 stock on the demonstrated extension.

9
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.500
Standing heavy punch picks up the Level 3 fall.

10
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.350
Heavy Arrow completes the post-Super juggle.
